    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.8.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 22:56:41 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Your recents and settings now sync through iCloud.</b> Spell something on the iPhone, and it&#x27;s in the Mac&#x27;s recents moments later — and they survive deleting and reinstalling. Nothing to sign in to; it uses the iCloud account you&#x27;re already on. Turn it off in Settings if you&#x27;d rather not.</p><p><b>Type weight</b> on the Mac now matches the iPhone.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.8.0/WTF-0.8.0.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="OovNtHHlhHQbFXgeppE1DedkXU4g6Gqi4iiRXrueDMN5uZDRL6G4M++KpxyfB7TAFPR40wdd4XBY5Y/2lEWQCQ==" length="3096135"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.7.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 17:36:41 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.7.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>New setting: Repeat first letter in word</b> — choose between <code>W  WHISKEY</code> and <code>W HISKEY</code>, where the keycap <i>is</i> the first letter. Settings → General.</p><p><b>Words are UPPERCASE by default</b> now, with a little more letter-spacing so caps breathe. Title case and lowercase are still there.</p><p><b>Refined keycaps</b> — no outline; a lit top edge and a soft shadow instead, so they read as keys in light and dark mode. Legend and word now share the same size and weight in SF Pro Rounded.</p><p>Same model as the iPhone app, which is on TestFlight.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.7.0/WTF-0.7.0.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="HeN8H2GuUM3IkyZOIM8SoVtOtGLTLoOBtxFaYX4KP4GLNipPxMMjnS9CCn/jrqs6vG3rKCZirbDDKb9Fc0tSBw==" length="3009541"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.6.0</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 18:58:45 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Refined app icon</b> — a more convincing keycap, with the legend sized like a real Magic Keyboard key.<br><br><b>Lighter popover buttons</b> — the settings and quit buttons are now bare, with a subtle circle that appears on hover. Slightly larger icons, more room between them.<br><br><b>Under the hood</b> — the app now runs on the same shared model as the upcoming iPhone version. Your recents and settings carry over unchanged.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.6.0/WTF-0.6.0.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="lC+n1nmtJ3vukhZbsws6b135CpHPJpCM0x2ClTxQmbfwsXZRn6DQOJWu6g6fxKabuxmy3tqN5IvoLKKpNvrLBQ==" length="3007377"/>
    </item>
